{"seq":3,"slug":"training-infrastructure","title":"训练基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/fine-tuning-fundamentals/training-infrastructure","wordCount":742,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"训练基础设施\">训练基础设施</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LLM 微调的训练基础设施选择直接影响训练成本、速度和模型质量。从消费级 GPU 到云端集群，不同的硬件配置适用于不同规模的微调任务。理解 GPU 显存需求、分布式训练策略和混合精度训练是合理规划基础设施的前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 单机训练&#10;        A[单 GPU] --&gt; B[多 GPU DataParallel]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 分布式训练&#10;        C[模型并行] --&gt; E[训练集群]&#10;        D[数据并行] --&gt; E&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; F{模型规模}&#10;    F --&gt;|&lt;7B| A&#10;    F --&gt;|7-13B| B&#10;    F --&gt;|&gt;13B| E\">graph TB\n    subgraph 单机训练\n        A[单 GPU] --&gt; B[多 GPU DataParallel]\n    end\n    subgraph 分布式训练\n        C[模型并行] --&gt; E[训练集群]\n        D[数据并行] --&gt; E\n    end\n    A --&gt; F{模型规模}\n    F --&gt;|&lt;7B| A\n    F --&gt;|7-13B| B\n    F --&gt;|&gt;13B| E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型规模</th>\n<th>全量微调显存</th>\n<th>LoRA 微调显存</th>\n<th>QLoRA 显存</th>\n<th>推荐 GPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1-3B</td>\n<td>12-24 GB</td>\n<td>6-12 GB</td>\n<td>4-8 GB</td>\n<td>RTX 4090</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7B</td>\n<td>56-112 GB</td>\n<td>14-28 GB</td>\n<td>8-16 GB</td>\n<td>A100 40G</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13B</td>\n<td>104-208 GB</td>\n<td>26-52 GB</td>\n<td>12-24 GB</td>\n<td>A100 80G</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70B</td>\n<td>560+ GB</td>\n<td>70-140 GB</td>\n<td>48-64 GB</td>\n<td>多 A100/H100</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-显存估算\">GPU 显存估算</h2><p>准确估算 GPU 显存需求是避免训练中途 OOM（Out of Memory）的关键。显存消耗主要来自模型参数、优化器状态、梯度和激活值四个部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MemoryEstimate {&#10;  modelParams: number;&#10;  optimizerState: number;&#10;  gradients: number;&#10;  activations: number;&#10;  total: number;&#10;  unit: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const estimateMemory = (config: {&#10;  paramsBillion: number;&#10;  precision: &#39;fp32&#39; | &#39;fp16&#39; | &#39;bf16&#39; | &#39;int8&#39; | &#39;int4&#39;;&#10;  optimizer: &#39;adam&#39; | &#39;sgd&#39; | &#39;adamw-8bit&#39;;&#10;  batchSize: number;&#10;  seqLength: number;&#10;  method: &#39;full&#39; | &#39;lora&#39; | &#39;qlora&#39;;&#10;  loraRank?: number;&#10;}): MemoryEstimate =&gt; {&#10;  const bytesPerParam: Record&lt;string, number&gt; = {&#10;    fp32: 4,&#10;    fp16: 2,&#10;    bf16: 2,&#10;    int8: 1,&#10;    int4: 0.5,&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  const paramBytes = config.paramsBillion * 1e9 * bytesPerParam[config.precision];&#10;&#10;  let trainableRatio = 1;&#10;  if (config.method === &#39;lora&#39;) trainableRatio = ((config.loraRank ?? 16) * 2) / 4096;&#10;  if (config.method === &#39;qlora&#39;) trainableRatio = ((config.loraRank ?? 16) * 2) / 4096;&#10;&#10;  const optimizerMultiplier: Record&lt;string, number&gt; = {&#10;    adam: 8,&#10;    sgd: 0,&#10;    &#39;adamw-8bit&#39;: 4,&#10;  };&#10;  const optimizerBytes = config.paramsBillion * 1e9 * trainableRatio * optimizerMultiplier[config.optimizer];&#10;&#10;  const gradientBytes = config.paramsBillion * 1e9 * trainableRatio * bytesPerParam[config.precision];&#10;  const activationBytes = config.batchSize * config.seqLength * 4096 * 4;&#10;&#10;  const totalGB = (paramBytes + optimizerBytes + gradientBytes + activationBytes) / 1e9;&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    modelParams: paramBytes / 1e9,&#10;    optimizerState: optimizerBytes / 1e9,&#10;    gradients: gradientBytes / 1e9,&#10;    activations: activationBytes / 1e9,&#10;    total: totalGB,&#10;    unit: &#39;GB&#39;,&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MemoryEstimate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;